The '''2026 Kansas State Treasurer election''' will be held on November 3, 2026, to elect the [[Treasurer of Kansas]], concurrently with elections to the [[2026 United States Senate election in Kansas|United States Senate]], [[2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Kansas|U.S. House of Representatives]], [[2026 Kansas gubernatorial election|governor]], and other [[2026 Kansas elections|state]] and [[2026 United States elections#Local elections|local]] elections. Primary elections were held on August 4, 2026.<ref>{{Cite web |title=2026 State Primary Election Dates |url=https://www.ncsl.org/elections-and-campaigns/2026-state-primary-election-dates |access-date=2026-07-06 |website=www.ncsl.org}}</ref>

